OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm often stopped on the street
OL,4,Afor confessions' - Retiring bishop
OL,5,Areflects on a life at the heart of the
OL,6,Acommunity
OL,7,
OL,8,FThe outgoing Catholic Bishop of Derry
OL,9,Fbelieves one of the biggest challenges
OL,10,Fof retirement will be getting used to
OL,11,Fhis phone "not ringing so often".
OL,13,FDonal McKeown has spent the past
OL,14,Fquarter of a century as a bishop, but
OL,15,Fon Sunday he will say his final Mass as
OL,16,Fhead of the diocese after 12 years.
OL,18,FBishop Michael Router will then be
OL,19,Finstalled at St Eugene's Cathedral.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
