OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm often stopped on the street
OL,4,Afor confessions' - Retiring bishop
OL,5,Areflects on a life at the heart of the
OL,6,Acommunity
OL,7,
OL,8,FAs he prepares to retire, Bishop
OL,9,FMcKeown has been reflecting on being
OL,10,Fpart of important moments in history
OL,11,Fand as well as being stopped on the
OL,12,Fstreet for confessions.
